{"ID":"20240118151155-ipj4c2e","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151155-ipj4c2e","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151155-ipj4c2e\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151155-5ipa9ws\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122123206-qfp7e31\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122123206-qfp7e31\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:209,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:209\u0026#125;","title":"161苦参","type":"doc","updated":"20240131142417"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151155-5ipa9ws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151155-5ipa9ws","updated":"20240122123122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦寒，主心腹结气，症瘕积聚，黄疸，溺有余湿，逐水，除痈肿，补中，明目，止泪。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122123126-xiruy15","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122123126-xiruy15"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产河南四川，各地山野及田畔湿地亦俱有之，根黄白色类牛蒡，甚苦，入药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122123129-6ea6qxq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122123129-6ea6qxq"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦，性寒，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122123131-q7ypq7l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122123131-q7ypq7l"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】苦参为燥湿胜热健胃杀虫积要药，主治积聚，症瘕，恶疮，疳症，泄血中热，清湿养阴。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122123132-2zc9phh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122123132-2zc9phh"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】养肝胆气，安五脏，除伏热，肠澼，止渴，醒酒，小便黄赤，疗恶疮下部虫。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122123134-jbvi1hl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122123134-jbvi1hl"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】治热毒风，皮肌烦躁，生疮，赤癞，眉脱，除大热，嗜睡，治腹中冷痛，中恶腹痛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122123136-s1yeuci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122123136-s1yeuci"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【弘景】渍酒饮治疥杀虫。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122123138-jkzyiqb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122123138-jkzyiqb"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【苏敬】治恶虫胫酸。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122123139-lezelj6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122123139-lezelj6"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【纲目】杀疳虫，炒存性，米饮服，治肠风泻血并热痢。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122123140-s33i16b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122123140-s33i16b"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【括要】遍身风疹，痛不可忍，肺热生疮，遍身皆是；瘰疬结核，下部疮瘺，诸般实症用之有效。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122123142-uwg4ybx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122123142-uwg4ybx"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【灵胎】清心肝火，去小肠热。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122123144-fbyq7an","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122123144-fbyq7an"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122123145-hjze6hh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122123145-hjze6hh"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】久服损肾气，肝肾虚而无大热者忌。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122123145-ah0hmq4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122123145-ah0hmq4"}},{"ID":"20240122123145-kfbbuuz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122123145-kfbbuuz"}},{"ID":"20240122123146-k80o5up","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122123146-k80o5up","updated":"20240131142225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第161味药，就是我们的苦参，瓜蒌根长这个样子，苦参这个用的范围也很多，范围很广。"}]},{"ID":"20240122123146-6qdar1h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122123146-6qdar1h","updated":"20240131142236"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦参顾名思义，味道是苦味的，这个山野田地之间很多，那主要的我们是去热，因为它是性寒的，药性是寒凉的药，寒药的话就能够去热，热结，比如你小便里有刺痛，身上有黄疸啊，都可以使用它。"}]},{"ID":"20240122123156-zmmfhfx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122123156-zmmfhfx","updated":"20240131142325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】，苦参的主治是燥湿胜热健胃杀虫积的主要的药物，那小便赤黄啊，阴部有湿疹啊，统统可以使用。苦参也可以煮了以后，汤在外洗用，外洗大部分是用在皮肤痒，这个皮肤痒的时候，有时候你一擦上去，对皮肤痒没有帮助，就不要再用苦参了，苦参有时候皮肤痒，有一部分的皮肤痒有效，一般来说这个荨麻疹可能会比较好一点，其它的像风疹块涂上去没有效了，那这个皮肤上有些寄生虫，苦参会有效。所以你如果说外用的时候苦参水一擦没有效，你就拿那个蛇床子，蛇床子一擦痒就去掉了，因为它能燥湿能够养肝胆之气，因为味苦么，苦味的药入心，子能令母实，心火跟肝是关系是母子的关系，所以我们苦参用的很多。"}]},{"ID":"20240122123206-qfp7e31","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122123206-qfp7e31","updated":"20240131142417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【括要】呢，遍身风疹，痛不可忍，肺热生疮，遍身都是；瘰疬阴结核，就是喉咙的硬块，身上的淋巴肿结，鼠蹊部部的肿块，统统可以用苦参，但是这个苦参因为它是寒性的药，一定要遇到热症，湿热的时候再去使用它。那苦参效果很好，像我自己治的那个戒烟方，因为我们这个鼠蹊部了坐很久，臀部这边生了一些湿疹，再配合一些清肺化痰的药，一吃下去，欲望就没了，这欲望就是看到香烟欲望就没了，自然而然就戒掉了。效果很好。那寒症的话就不要用，因为它是寒药么。"}]}]}